<title>UKRAINE: Ukraine PPI rises to 1.2 pct mth/mth in November.</title>
<headline>Ukraine PPI rises to 1.2 pct mth/mth in November.</headline>
<dateline>KIEV 1996-12-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Ukranian industrial prices rose by a month-on-month rate of 1.2 percent in November after a rise of 0.1 percent in October, the Statistics Ministry said on Thursday.</p>
<p>    UKRAINE INDUSTRIAL PRICES   Nov 96   Oct 96   Nov 95</p>
<p>    Month-on-month pct change    +1.2     +0.1     +4.2</p>
<p>    Year-on-year pct change     +16.2    +14.8   +165.1</p>
<p>--Kiev newsroom, +380 44 229 2264</p>
</text>
